=Missile Launcher Tower=
*Based on [[units/turrets/Missile Launcher|Missile Launcher]] turret
*  Health: 24 [=16*1.5 (turret health multiplier)]
*  Price: %Minerals% 80
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 2 [=4-2 (tower modifier)]
*  [[concepts/attack range|Hrz. Attack range]]: 9=[7]+2 (Tower Bonus) (Missile)
*  Does not require ammunition
*  1 attack per round
*  Explosion radius: 1
*  Damage: 10
Units or ground locations can be attacked if in range.
The Missile Launcher tower-turret intercepts hostile mobile units during their movement [[concepts/phase]]. It is thus particularly well suited to defend strategically important regions.
